## Proposed Changes

### Tech Stack
-   **No changes**: React + TS + Vite + IndexedDB + Vanilla CSS.

### Data Layer Architecture

#### [NEW] Entities ([src/types/finance.ts](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/types/finance.ts))
-   [Account](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/types/finance.ts#3-11): Bank Account (ID, Name, Balance).
-   [Card](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/contexts/FinanceContext.tsx#76-90): Payment Method (ID, Name, Type: Debit/Credit, LinkedAccountId, CutoffDay, PaymentDay).
-   [Transaction](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/services/db.ts#123-141): Unified record for realized movements? Or separate Expense entity? -> **Separate [Expense](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/types/finance.ts#28-39) entity** for clarity.
-   [Expense](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/types/finance.ts#28-39): (ID, Amount, Date, Category, PaymentMethodId, IsFixed).
-   [SavingGoal](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/types/finance.ts#40-48) (Hucha): (ID, Name, TargetAmount, CurrentAmount).
-   [SavingAllocation](file:///C:/Users/pablo/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/domestic-economy-app/src/types/finance.ts#49-56): Record of money moved to savings.

#### [MODIFY] Income Entity
-   Add `linkedAccountId`: ID of the account where money is received.
-   Add `status`: 'pending' | 'received'.
-   Add `effectiveDate`: Date when money actually hit the bank.

### Core Logic (`src/services/financeLogic.ts`)
-   **Forecasting**: Function to generate "Virtual" transactions for future months based on Fixed Incomes/Expenses.
-   **Cash Flow**: Calculate daily/monthly balance accounting for Credit Card payment dates.
-   **Available to Spend**: Real-time calculation based on current month's data.

